error[E0277]: `u8` is not a storage of `Int`
 --> tests/ui/native_sign_mismatch.rs:5:24
  |
5 |   let _: Int<U7, u8> = Default::default();
  |                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the trait `IntRepr` is not implemented for `u8`
  |
  = note: `Int` stores a signed native integer, `i8` to `i128`, or an array `[u8; N]` to `[u128; N]` of unsigned limbs in two's complement
  = help: the following other types implement trait `IntRepr`:
            i128
            i16
            i32
            i64
            i8
  = note: required for `numo::Int<UInt<UInt<UInt<UTerm, B1>, B1>, B1>, u8>` to implement `Default`

